      "role": "user",
      "content": "That spy analogy is a bit of a stretch for a science class, but I take your point about the stealthy nature of the gas. Could you clarify the part about it crossing the blood-brain barrier? That sounds quite intense for an onion reaction—is that a standard part of the physiological impact, or are you exaggerating the effect?",
